{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28370","headline":"池州春送前进士蒯希逸 · 杜牧","name":"池州春送前进士蒯希逸","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"芳草复芳草，断肠还断肠。\n自然堪下泪，何必更残阳。\n楚岸千万里，燕鸿三两行。\n有家归不得，况举别君觞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜牧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28370.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28370","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、古籍注评：《才调集》（中文维基文库，CC BY-SA 4.0，https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/才調集_(四庫全書本)）"}